## 9.4 Selected farm styling

The selected farm needs stronger visual emphasis.

Recommended styling:

- Teal/white outline.
- Slightly increased line thickness.
- Subtle translucent fill.
- Visible boundary vertices only during edit mode.
- Area label near polygon centre.

Selection must not destroy the underlying health status.

One option is to render the selected farm on a separate overlay layer.

```ts
map.addLayer({
  id: "selected-farm-outline",

  type: "line",

  source: "selected-farm",

  paint: {
    "line-color": "#43F5D0",
    "line-width": 3.5
  }
});
```

The selected outline can be drawn above the ordinary health-colored outline.

